<title>HONG KONG: Logic reports HK$28.3 mln interim loss.</title>
<headline>Logic reports HK$28.3 mln interim loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.9 loss  vs  3.1 gain (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    28.33 loss vs  5.94 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     165.83     vs  156.46</p>
<p>    Company name		 Logic International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Logic is an office funiture distributor. Shares earnings adjusted for a 1-for-2 rights share issue made in July 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
